 trip reference, date, suburbs and fare for our records, and invoice details for 5 years because tax law requires it.'=>'此操作会让您退出登录，并删除您的账户、已保存的乘客、客户和地址。您过往行程中的姓名、联系方式和街道地址将被删除。我们会保留行程编号、日期、所在区和车费作为记录；根据税法要求，发票信息将保留 5 年。','Your password'=>'您的密码','I understand this cannot be undone.'=>'我明白此操作无法撤销。','Customer downloaded their data from My Account'=>'客户已从“我的账户”下载其数据','Your password was not right, so your account was not deleted.'=>'您的密码不正确，因此账户未被删除。','You have upcoming trips. Please cancel them first.'=>'您还有即将到来的行程。请先取消这些行程。','Customer deleted their account'=>'客户已删除其账户','Customer account deleted (%s)'=>'客户账户已删除（%s）','A customer deleted their account'=>'一位客户删除了其账户','A customer account was deleted from My Account. Personal details were removed from %d trips; references, dates, suburbs and fares were kept.'=>'一位客户在“我的账户”中删除了其账户。已从 %d 次行程中删除个人信息；编号、日期、所在区和车费已保留。','Thanks for sharing your experience on Google!'=>'感谢您在 Google 上分享您的体验！','Would you share your experience on Google?'=>'您愿意在 Google 上分享您的体验吗？','A short review helps other families and carers find accessible transport they can trust. It takes about a minute.'=>'一条简短的评价可以帮助其他家庭和护理人员找到值得信赖的无障碍交通服务。只需大约一分钟。','Write a Google review'=>'撰写 Google 评价','Customer opened the Google review link'=>'客户打开了 Google 评价链接','there'=>'尊敬的顾客','Thank you for rating your trip with us — it really helps.'=>'感谢您为我们的行程评分——这对我们帮助很大。','Would you also share your experience on Google? A short review helps other families and carers find accessible transport they can trust.'=>'您愿意也在 Google 上分享您的体验吗？一条简短的评价可以帮助其他家庭和护理人员找到值得信赖的无障碍交通服务。','Thank you for travelling with us.'=>'感谢您乘坐我们的车。','Thank you for your rating'=>'感谢您的评分','Google review invitation emailed'=>'已通过电子邮件发送 Google 评价邀请','Please complete the "I am human" check and try again.'=>'请完成“我是真人”验证后重试。','Wheelchair accessible taxi in %1$s. Ramp and hoist vehicles, trained drivers, door-to-door. Book online or call %2$s.'=>'%1$s 的无障碍轮椅出租车。配备坡道和升降机的车辆，训练有素的司机，门到门服务。请在线预约或致电 %2$s。','Wheelchair accessi