e.'=>'将各类咨询分别引导到正确去处的按钮。','Pattern titleContact details + map'=>'联系方式 + 地图','Pattern descriptionPhone, email, hours and a map side by side.'=>'电话、电子邮箱、营业时间和地图并排显示。','Pattern titleCall to action (yellow band)'=>'行动号召（黄色横栏）','Pattern descriptionBright band with phone and booking buttons.'=>'带有电话和预约按钮的醒目横栏。','Pattern titlePopular destinations'=>'热门目的地','Pattern descriptionMost-booked destinations from real (anonymised) bookings, with Book buttons.'=>'根据真实（已匿名处理）预约统计的最常预约目的地，附带“预约”按钮。','Pattern titleMeet the drivers'=>'认识我们的司机','Pattern descriptionPublic driver profiles (only drivers who have opted in).'=>'司机公开资料（仅限已选择同意的司机）。','Pattern titleFAQ accordion'=>'常见问题折叠列表','Pattern descriptionFrequently asked questions (edit them under FAQs).'=>'常见问题（请在“常见问题”下编辑）。','Pattern titleFeature cards (3 columns)'=>'特色卡片（3 栏）','Pattern descriptionThree highlight cards — edit the headings and text.'=>'三张重点卡片——可编辑标题和文字。','Purpose-built vehicles'=>'专门设计的车辆','Pattern titleHero banner'=>'主横幅','Pattern descriptionLarge navy banner with headline, intro and booking buttons. Use at the top of a "Blank canvas" page.'=>'大型深蓝色横幅，含主标题、简介和预约按钮。请放在“空白画布”页面的顶部。','Pattern titleAbout Us page'=>'“关于我们”页面','Pattern descriptionStarter content for an About Us page.'=>'“关于我们”页面的初始内容。','Pattern titleAccessibility statement page'=>'无障碍声明页面','Pattern descriptionAccessibility statement draft covering your commitment, features, known limitations and how to give feedback.'=>'无障碍声明草稿，涵盖您的承诺、无障碍功能、已知局限以及如何提供反馈。','Pattern titleDrive with us page'=>'“加入我们当司机”页面','Pattern descriptionStarter content for a driver recruitment page, with [CONFIRM] notes for pay and conditions.'=>'司机招聘页面的初始内容，薪酬和工作条件处附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。','Pattern titleComplaints & feedback page'=>'投诉和反馈页面','Pattern descriptionA clear complaints process with steps, response times ([CONFIRM]) and how to escalate to regulators.'=>'清晰的投诉流程，包括步骤、回复时限（[CONFIRM]）以及如何向监管机构申诉。','What happens next'=>'接下来会怎样','Pattern titlePrivacy policy page'=>'隐私政策页面','Pattern descriptionPrivacy policy that follows the Australian Privacy Principles and updates from your settings, with a request form.'=>'遵循《澳大利亚隐私原则》并根据您的设置自动更新的隐私政策，附申请表。','Pattern titleSeasonal / event landing page'=>'季节性 / 活动着陆页','Pattern descriptionLanding page for an event or season (footy finals, Christmas, spring racing). Schedule it with Publish → Schedule and set "Unpublish automatically".'=>'用于某项活动或季节的着陆页（澳式足球决赛、圣诞节、春季赛马）。请通过“发布 → 定时”安排上线时间，并设置“自动取消发布”。','Pattern titleTerms & cancellation policy page'=>'条款和取消政策页面','Pattern descriptionStructured draft for your booking terms and cancellation policy, with [CONFIRM] notes where your real policy is needed.'=>'预约条款和取消政策的结构化草稿，需要填写您实际政策的地方附有 [CONFIRM] 提示。','Pattern titlePartner logos'=>'合作伙伴标志','Pattern descriptionLogos of partner organisations (only those with permission ticked).'=>'合作机构的标志（仅限已勾选许可的机构）。','Pattern titleBlog: local destination guide'=>'博客：本地目的地指南','Pattern descriptionOutline for posts like "Wheelchair taxi to [hospital]: what to expect".'=>'适用于“乘坐轮椅出租车前往 [医院]：须知事项”这类文章的大纲。','Book a wheelchair taxi'=>'预约轮椅出租车','Pattern titleBlog: travel tips list'=>'博客：出行小贴士清单','Pattern descriptionOutline for step-by-step advice posts.'=>'适用于分步建议类文章的大纲。','Pattern titleAnimated scene: airport drop-off and pickup'=>'动画场景：机场送机和接机','Pattern descriptionDrop-off at Departures, pickup at Arrivals, and a plane taking off. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'在出发大厅送客、在到达大厅接客，还有一架正在起飞的飞机。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。','Pattern titleAnimated scene: door-to-door wheelchair pickup'=>'动画场景：门到门轮椅接送','Pattern descriptionA maxi taxi pulls up, lowers its ramp and a passenger rolls aboard. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'一辆大型出租车停下，放下坡道，一位乘客坐着轮椅上车。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。','Pattern titleAnimated strip: taxis driving by'=>'动画横条：驶过的出租车','Pattern descriptionA narrow road with a maxi taxi and taxis driving past. Follows your colours, and visitors can pause it.'=>'一条窄窄的道路，一辆大型出租车和几辆出租车驶过。会跟随您的配色，访客可以暂停。','Pattern titleServices grid'=>'服务网格','Pattern descriptionCards for every published Service (updates automatically).'=>'每项已发布服务的卡片（自动更新）。','Pattern titleLive trust numbers'=>'实时信誉数据','Pattern descriptionTrips completed, suburbs served and years in business — updates itself from your bookings.'=>'已完成行程、已服务的区和经营年数——根据您的预约自动更新。','Pattern titleHow it works (steps)'=>'服务流程（步骤）','Pattern descriptionNumbered steps explaining how booking works.'=>'说明预约流程的编号步骤。','By phone, SMS or email.'=>'通过电话、短信或电子邮件。','Your driver helps you in and out.'=>'司机会协助您上下车。','Pattern titleDo you cover my suburb? checker'=>'“你们的服务覆盖我所在的区吗？”查询工具','Pattern descriptionInstant answer for visitors checking if you cover their suburb or postcode.'=>'访客查询您是否覆盖其所在区或邮编时，可立即得到答案。','Pattern titleTestimonials'=>'客户推荐','Pattern descriptionYour published testimonials and Google rating.'=>'您已发布的客户推荐和 Google 评分。','Pattern titleOur values (4 columns)'=>'我们的价值观（4 栏）','Pattern descriptionFour short value statements.'=>'四条简短的价值观陈述。','Pattern titleWheelchair safety video'=>'轮椅安全视频','Pattern descriptionCaptioned video with transcript — set it up in Customize → Taxi Peninsula → Wheelchair safety video.'=>'带字幕和文字稿的视频——请在“自定义 → Taxi Peninsula → 轮椅安全视频”中设置。','Search for:'=>'搜索：','Search articles…'=>'搜索文章…','Sidebar'=>'侧边栏','Book online in two minutes or call our team.'=>'两分钟在线预约，或致电我们的团队。','Categories'=>'分类','Need an accessible ride in %1$s? %2$s provides wheelchair accessible taxis with ramps or hoists, wheelchair restraints and drivers trained to help you in and out safely.'=>'在 %1$s 需要无障碍出行？%2$s 提供无障碍轮椅出租车，配备坡道或升降机和轮椅固定带，司机经过培训，可以安全地协助您上下车。','We pick up from homes, hospitals, aged-care residences and day programs in %s and take you anywhere across Melbourne and the Mornington Peninsula — including Melbourne and Avalon airports.'=>'我们可从 %s 的住家、医院、养老院和日间活动中心接您，送您前往墨尔本和莫宁顿半岛的任何地方——包括墨尔本机场和阿瓦隆（Avalon）机场。','Places we often travel to around %s'=>'%s 周边我们常去的地方','Getting around %s'=>'在 %s 出行','Popular trips from %s'=>'从 %s 出发的热门行程','Guides for %s'=>'%s 出行指南','Questions about travelling in %s'=>'关于在 %s 出行的问题','Nearby areas'=>'附近区域','Other areas we cover'=>'我们服务的其他区域','Book this trip'=>'预约此行程','More services'=>'更多服务','Ready to book?'=>'准备好预约了吗？','Other services'=>'其他服务','Pages:'=>'页码：','Booking steps'=>'预约步骤','Your trip'=>'您的行程','Street address, suburb'=>'街道地址，区名','e.g. Frankston Hospital, Melbourne Airport'=>'例如：Frankston 医院、墨尔本机场','Estimate only, based on the usual driving route. The final fare depends on traffic, waiting time and route, and any MPTP subsidy is applied by the driver.'=>'仅为估算，根据通常的行车路线计算。最终车费取决于交通状况、等候时间和路线，MPTP 补贴（如有）由司机计算扣除。','I need a return trip'=>'我需要回程','Return pick-up time (if known)'=>'回程上车时间（如已确定）','This is a regular trip (e.g. dialysis, therapy, day program)'=>'这是定期行程（例如透析、治疗、日间活动）','Repeat every'=>'每周重复于','Until'=>'截至','Same times each day, for up to %d weeks. Each trip gets its own reference so it can be changed separately.'=>'每天时间相同，最长 %d 周。每次行程都有自己的预约编号，可以单独更改。','Accessibility needs'=>'无障碍需求','I am a Multi Purpose Taxi Program (MPTP) member'=>'我是多用途出租车计划（MPTP）会员','Anything we should know?'=>'还有什么需要我们知道的吗？','e.g. wheelchair dimensions, carer travelling, assistance to the door, flight number'=>'例如：轮椅尺寸、有护理人员同行、需协助到门口、航班号','How will you pay?'=>'您打算如何付款？','Plan manager, provider or company'=>'计划管理人、服务提供者或公司','NDIS number or purchase order (optional)'=>'NDIS 号码或采购订单号（选填）','After you submit, you will be taken to Stripe’s secure checkout to pay the deposit. The rest of the fare is paid at the end of the trip.'=>'提交后，您将被转到 Stripe 的安全付款页面支付订金。其余车费在行程结束时支付。','Your details'=>'您的资料','I agree to be contacted by phone, SMS or email about this booking, and for you to use the mobility and health details I give to arrange the trip.'=>'我同意你们就此预约通过电话、短信或电子邮件与我联系，并同意你们使用我提供的行动能力和健康信息来安排行程。','I have read and accept the %s.'=>'我已阅读并接受%s。','terms and cancellation policy'=>'条款和取消政策','Request booking'=>'提交预约申请','Travelling in the next hour? Call %s'=>'一小时内出行？请致电 %s','Find your booking'=>'查找您的预约','Enter the reference from your confirmation (it starts with TP-) and the mobile number you booked with.'=>'请输入确认信息中的预约编号（以 TP- 开头）以及预约时使用的手机号码。','Show my booking'=>'显示我的预约','Lost your reference? Call %s.'=>'找不到预约编号？请致电 %s。','Online deposit'=>'在线订金','Thanks — we have received your request.'=>'谢谢——我们已收到您的申请。','Our team will contact you to confirm.'=>'我们的团队会与您联系确认。','Payment complete — thank you.'=>'付款完成——谢谢您。','It can take a minute for the payment to show below.'=>'付款可能需要一分钟左右才会显示在下方。','The payment was not completed. You can try again below or pay the driver.'=>'付款未完成。您可以在下方重试，或向司机付款。','This booking has been cancelled.'=>'此预约已取消。','Our driver arrived but could not find you, so this trip was marked as a no-show. Please call us if this is a mistake.'=>'我们的司机已到达，但没有找到您，因此本次行程被记录为“乘客未到”。如有误会，请致电我们。','Your driver is on the way.'=>'您的司机正在路上。','Your driver has arrived.'=>'您的司机已到达。','Booking progress'=>'预约进度','Time to be arranged'=>'时间待定','%1$d passenger(s), %2$d wheelchair(s)'=>'%1$d 位乘客，%2$d 台轮椅','estimate only'=>'仅为估算','Your notes'=>'您的备注','Pay %s deposit securely'=>'安全支付 %s 订金','This is part of a repeat booking (%d trips)'=>'这是重复预约中的一次行程（共 %d 次）','Your %s is with our team. We will contact you shortly.'=>'您的%s已转交我们的团队。我们会尽快与您联系。','Change or cancel this booking'=>'更改或取消此预约','What would you like to do?'=>'您想做什么？','Change the time, address or details'=>'更改时间、地址或详情','Cancel this trip'=>'取消此行程','Cancel all remaining trips in this repeat booking'=>'取消此重复预约中所有剩余的行程','e.g. Please change the pick-up to 10:15am'=>'例如：请把上车时间改为上午 10:15','Requests are handled by our team. For changes within the next two hours, please call us.'=>'申请由我们的团队处理。如需更改两小时内的行程，请致电我们。','Questions about your trip? Call %s.'=>'对行程有疑问？请致电 %s。','Thanks — your booking request is in!'=>'谢谢——您的预约申请已提交！','Your reference'=>'您的预约编号','%d trip has been requested.'=>'已申请 %d 次行程。','Each trip has its own reference, listed in your confirmation email.'=>'每次行程都有自己的预约编号，列在您的确认电子邮件中。','We saved your booking but could not open the online payment page. You can pay the driver instead, or try again from your booking page.'=>'我们已保存您的预约，但无法打开在线付款页面。您可以改为向司机付款，或在预约页面重试。','We confirm your booking'=>'我们确认您的预约','By SMS or email — usually within the hour during opening times.'=>'通过短信或电子邮件——营业时间内通常在一小时内确认。','Your driver is assigned'=>'为您指派司机','We text you their first name and the vehicle.'=>'我们会用短信告诉您司机的名字和车辆。','On the day'=>'出行当天','You get a text when your driver is on the way and when they arrive.'=>'司机出发前往和到达时，您都会收到短信。','View booking'=>'查看预约','Book the return trip'=>'预约回程','Make another booking'=>'再预约一次','See all your trips in My Account'=>'在“我的账户”中查看所有行程','Book often? %s to see every trip in one place and rebook in one tap.'=>'经常预约？%s，即可在一处查看所有行程，并一键重新预约。','Create a free account'=>'创建免费账户','Need to change something? Call %s and quote your reference.'=>'需要更改？请致电 %s，并提供您的预约编号。','Nothing here yet'=>'这里暂时还没有内容','No results matched your search. Try different words.'=>'没有与您的搜索相符的结果。请换个词试试。','Check back soon for news and travel tips.'=>'请稍后再来查看新闻和出行小贴士。','a trip to %s'=>'前往 %s 的行程','Guide'=>'指南','to travelling to %s'=>'：前往 %s 出行','Rear-entry ramps or hoists and four-point restraints, so you can stay in your own chair.'=>'后门进入的坡道或升降机，以及四点式固定带，让您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上。','Trained, accredited drivers'=>'训练有素的持证司机','Our drivers are experienced in loading, securing and assisting passengers with a disability.'=>'我们的司机在协助残障乘客上车、固定轮椅和提供帮助方面经验丰富。','Punctual, 24/7'=>'准时守约，全天候服务','Book ahead for appointments and flights, or call us for a same-day pick-up.'=>'就医预约和航班请提前预约，当天接送请致电我们。','Carers welcome'=>'欢迎护理人员同行','Family members and support workers can travel with you at no extra hassle.'=>'家人和支持工作者可以轻松地与您同行。','Prefer to talk to someone?'=>'想和真人通话？','See all FAQs'=>'查看所有常见问题','Pickups from your door'=>'上门接送','Our maxi taxis back up close, lower the ramp and help you aboard. You stay in your own chair, secured with four-point restraints.'=>'我们的大型出租车会倒车靠近，放下坡道并扶您上车。您可以一直坐在自己的轮椅上，并用四点式固定带固定。','Book a pickup'=>'预约接送','Airport drop-offs & pickups'=>'机场送机和接机','Straight to Departures, and waiting at Arrivals when you land — with room for luggage and mobility equipment.'=>'直接送到出发大厅，您落地时我们在到达大厅等候——还有足够空间放行李和助行设备。','Book an airport transfer'=>'预约机场接送','All articles'=>'所有文章','Start a booking'=>'开始预约','Where to?'=>'去哪里？','Continue'=>'继续','Suburbs in this article'=>'本文涉及的区','Travelling in this area?'=>'在这个地区出行？','Keep reading'=>'继续阅读','About our service in numbers'=>'用数字了解我们的服务','Send your request'=>'提交您的申请','Takes about two minutes.'=>'大约只需两分钟。','We confirm'=>'我们确认','Ride in comfort'=>'舒适出行','Rated %1$s out of 5 from %2$d Google review'=>'Google 评分 %1$s 分（满分 5 分），共 %2$d 条评价','Rated %s out of 5 on Google'=>'Google 评分 %s 分（满分 5 分）','%d out of 5 stars'=>'%d 星（满分 5 星）','View on Google'=>'在 Google 上查看','Reviews from Google, shown as written by reviewers.'=>'来自 Google 的评价，按评价者原文显示。','Read or leave a review on Google'=>'在 Google 上阅读或发表评价','Your trip so far'=>'您目前的行程信息','Travelling'=>'出行人员','Estimate'=>'估算','Return'=>'回程','See exactly how our drivers load, secure and unload a wheelchair — so you know what to expect before your first trip.'=>'看看我们的司机如何让轮椅上车、固定轮椅和下车——让您在第一次乘车前就心中有数。','Read the transcript'=>'阅读文字稿','Play video: %s (with captions)'=>'播放视频：%s（带字幕）','Plays from YouTube (privacy-enhanced mode).'=>'通过 YouTube 播放（隐私增强模式）。','Plays from Vimeo.'=>'通过 Vimeo 播放。','FAQ'=>'常见问题','Book a Taxi'=>'预约出租车','Manage My Booking'=>'管理我的预约','My Account'=>'我的账户','Contact Us'=>'联系我们','Our Fleet'=>'我们的车队','Driver Jobs'=>'司机任务','Our Services'=>'我们的服务','About Us'=>'关于我们','NDIS & Aged Care'=>'NDIS 与老年护理','Privacy Policy'=>'隐私政策','Accessibility Statement'=>'无障碍声明','Terms & Cancellation Policy'=>'条款与取消政策','Complaints & Feedback'=>'投诉与反馈','Drive With Us'=>'加入我们当司机']];